# the screen reader (fm1-reader, announce.c): the pages, the knobs, the help cards and each new riddim
wait 300
listen
wait 300
where
wait 300
said Desk page: Engineer Busy, Echo 50, Time 3/16, Bass 70. Style Sixpence Bass, rolling
tap ENV
wait 400
said Band page
spin K1 -3
wait 300
said Drums 67
tap EDIT
wait 300
said NEXT RIDDIM
wait 14000
said Version 2
press SAVE
wait 1200
said SAVE button. SAVES EVERY STYLE
release SAVE
wait 300
tap PLAY
wait 300
said STOPPED
where
wait 300
said Style Sixpence Bass, stopped
speakdump
